SWEET AMP SLOT SCAN (patch 0390, plan A10f), on top of 0389: boot-arg sweetaoc=12. Run a10e (0389) measured no PCM on ASPRX1: the CSPL
temperature followed DSP1 RX3/RX4 = VPMON (0x7fffff) and went back to the 0x5c000 default on ASPRX1, and stayed exactly there with the tone
playing (AOC ASP on and ASP_BYPASS alike). This level asks where the AOC data is: DAC and RX3/RX4 on ASPRX1, a continuous -12 dBFS tone
(pattern 9), ASP_WIDTH_RX 32 (WL 24) then 16 (WL 16), ASPRX1 slot 0..7 on both amps, 1 s each, meter line "d3" + CSPL meters per step
(tag w<width>s<slot>); then the 0388 words back, RX3/RX4 VMON/IMON, DAC source DSP, the 0384 power-down. Levels <= 11 unchanged.

